            "eyebrow": "The idea behind Brisa",
            "title": "A lamp with room to breathe.",
            "text": "<p>Brisa is designed around lightness: a soft, continuous form that feels present without becoming the centre of the room.</p>",
            "show_accordion": true,
            "accordion_1_heading": "Product details",
            "accordion_1_content": "<p>Compact table lamp with five colour options and a warm, welcoming presence.</p>",
